            "label": "Blueberry",
            "line": "Ripe, jammy fruit up front"
          }
        },
        "note-2": {
          "type": "note",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Cacao nib",
            "line": "A dry, dark-chocolate middle"
          }
        },
        "note-3": {
          "type": "note",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Jasmine",
            "line": "Floral lift as it cools"
          }
        },
        "note-4": {
          "type": "note",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Honey",
            "line": "A long, sweet finish"
          }
        },
        "info-5": {
          "type": "info",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Details",
            "body": "<p>Heirloom Ethiopian varieties grown at 2,100 m by 640 smallholders around Hambela. Dried whole on raised beds for 21 days. Roasted light for filter, with an omni curve that also pulls a fruity espresso.</p>"
          }
        },
        "info-6": {
          "type": "info",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping & returns",
            "body": "<p>Roasted Monday, shipped Tuesday in a recyclable valve bag. Free shipping over $45, otherwise $5. If a bag isn't for you, tell us within 30 days and we'll swap it or refund it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "info-7": {
          "type": "info",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Brew notes",
            "body": "<p>Pour-over: 15 g to 250 g water at 94 °C, 3:00 total. Espresso: 18 g in, 40 g out in 28 s. Rest the beans 7 days after the roast date for the sweetest cup.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
